{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33973","headline":"怀华阳润卿博士三首 一 · 皮日休","name":"怀华阳润卿博士三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"先生一向事虚皇，天市坛西与世忘。\n环堵养龟看气诀，刀圭饵犬试仙方。\n静探石脑衣裾润，闲链松脂院落香。\n闻道徵贤须有诏，不知何日到良常。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33973.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33973","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}